  "exact_local_progress": [
    "Identified and removed two receiver mismatches: ordinary a/h cutoff cannot cover larger external L6 p2 up to D; ordinary baselineCap cannot replace the original enhanced pair root seed. The new pair range is literal epsilon..59/250 and keeps rough carrier ceiling separate.",
    "Constructed finite pair SourceForm selector reusing exact original affine forms, support masks, whole-box winner gaps and inherited priority. Proved actual epsilon..D points lie below selected rational upper endpoints and receive both original full/selected-complement prefix squares.",
    "Constructed seed-specific pairPlan: third reads actual seed, fourth/fifth read that same plan previous frozen caps. Proved real fifth state cap from the computed run, then exact selected SourceForm row cap from primitive freshCheck; no prior hcap equality is assumed.",
    "Proved pairPlan_fresh_cap_bound for arbitrary incoming cap<=153/256. transfer_trace independently consumes this exact frozen source for actual raw/rank/rounded sigma support.",
    "Instantiated native U5 rho and U6 LowerData using the original piecewise root level minus the explicit double buffer. U6 preserves original w/L and the identical outer E mask. Nonzero native coefficients give actual rough carrier words without a policy-equality hypothesis.",
    "Combined actual selected fifth SourceForm, computed warm H5 cap and accepted rough continuation to output once-buffer full/selected-complement gates plus product*L<N^physical. The old scalar hcap premise has been eliminated."
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "This is a concrete source-only candidate receiver/native instance, not proof that all original adopted L5/L6 branches are globally supplied. The complete finite bank and every native chosen word classification into fresh/inherit/short branches remain open.",
    "Original arithmetic SourceForm/W licensing and complete mixed W/tent adoption are not provided. formRankEligible still deliberately excludes W, as in its original supplier.",
    "The actual compact cutoff hypothesis coordinate>=R.epsilon and pre-arithmetic L<=N^buffer allocation remain; uniform chamber coverage, wall/compiler loss and common convergence must supply them globally.",
    "freshCheck remains explicit primitive parent<candidate, candidate<=top and actual even arrival inequality checked before arithmetic. These are not replaced by final modulus or hLower hypotheses.",
    "Short and inherited branches are not falsely forced through the fresh rank-five theorem. Their original support and scalar budget paths remain distinct unfinished work.",
    "The final global same-rho native small-attachment call, complete canonical factor/collision handling, density/ordinary mean and signed AP/BV/PP estimates remain open."
  ],
